<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Unit History — {{ site.title }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Unit history records for D Company, 2nd Battalion, 8th Cavalry (Airmobile), 1965–1972.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>

{% include "partials/masthead.njk" %}

<div class="breadcrumb show">
  <a class="bc-link" href="/">Archive</a>
  <span class="bc-sep">›</span>
  <span>Unit History</span>
</div>

<main>

<div class="doc-hero">
  <h1 class="doc-hero-title">Unit History</h1>
  <div class="doc-hero-byline">D Company, 2nd Battalion, 8th Cavalry (Airmobile) · 1965–1972</div>
</div>

<style>
  /* First in / Last out top matter */
  .uh-era { border-left: 4px solid var(--y); background: var(--pg2); padding: 20px 24px; margin: 22px 48px 0; border-radius: 0; }
  .uh-era-kicker { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--dim); font-size: .82rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .uh-era-title { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.55rem; margin: 2px 0 10px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .uh-era p { font-family: "Crimson Pro", Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .uh-era p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .uh-era .uh-era-note { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--dim); font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }

  /* Year sub-headers inside each type tab */
  .uh-yr { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 30px 0 8px; }
  .tab-content > .uh-yr:first-child { margin-top: 4px; }
  .uh-yr-label { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: .03em; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1; }
  .uh-yr-count { font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--dim); }
  .uh-yr-line { flex: 1; height: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .uh-count { opacity: .55; font-weight: 400; }
  .uh-bookend { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; background: #1d9e75; color: #fff; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 99px; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; white-space: nowrap; }
  .uh-tabintro { font-family: 'Crimson Pro', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; color: var(--dim); margin: 0 0 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .uh-era { margin: 18px 16px 0; padding: 16px 18px; } }
</style>

<section class="uh-era" aria-label="Unit history milestone: the division departs, the brigade stays">
  <div class="uh-era-kicker">First In, Last Out · 1965–1972</div>
  <h2 class="uh-era-title">The First Team Goes Home — The Brigade Stays</h2>

  <p>
    The 1st Cavalry Division was the first U.S. Army division to deploy to Vietnam,
    in 1965, and it would be the last to leave. On <strong>26 March 1971</strong> the
    division officially ended its combat duties in Vietnam, and through that spring the
    bulk of the "First Team" redeployed to Fort Hood, Texas. But Vietnamization and the
    phased American withdrawal still called for a strong U.S. combat presence, so the
    division did not leave entirely.
  </p>

  <p>
    On <strong>30 April 1971</strong> the <strong>3rd Brigade, 1st Cavalry Division
    (Separate)</strong> — the "<strong>Garryowen Task Force</strong>" — was organized at
    Bien Hoa to carry on. It was built from four maneuver battalions, among them
    <strong>2nd Battalion, 8th Cavalry</strong>, alongside the 2nd Battalion, 5th
    Cavalry; 1st Battalion, 7th Cavalry; and 1st Battalion, 12th Cavalry — plus F Troop,
    9th Cavalry and the 215th Support Battalion. D Company's parent battalion was one of
    the units that stayed. The brigade's focus shifted from the Tay Ninh / War Zone C
    border screen of the late 1960s to interdiction in <strong>War Zone D</strong> and the
    defense of the <strong>Saigon–Long Binh</strong> complex. It was now the last U.S.
    Army ground combat brigade in the country.
  </p>

  <p>
    This is the hinge of D Company's later story. Every record on this page from 1971 and
    1972 — the FSB Fontaine contacts of April 1971, the loss at Núi Bà that October, the
    Chinook crash of May 1972 — happened <em>after</em> the division had gone home, while
    these men kept fighting under the Separate brigade. The April 1971 Fontaine actions
    fell during the stand-down itself, as the division packed up around them. The brigade
    finally cased its colors on <strong>20 June 1972</strong> and departed for Fort Hood
    on <strong>29 June 1972</strong> — first in, last out.
  </p>

  <p class="uh-era-note">
    The records below are grouped by kind — contacts, incidents, crashes, operations,
    morale, and memorials — and ordered by year within each. Select a tab to explore.
  </p>
</section>

{# ── Collect published events ── #}
{% set publishedEvents = [] %}
{% for evt in collections.events %}
  {% if evt.data.status == "published" %}
    {% set publishedEvents = (publishedEvents.push(evt), publishedEvents) %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if publishedEvents.length == 0 %}
  <div class="tab-content"><div class="tab-empty">
    No unit history records have been published yet. Check back soon.
  </div></div>
{% else %}

  {% set typeSections = [
    { "type": "contact",   "label": "Contact",   "intro": "Engagements and firefights involving D Company." },
    { "type": "incident",  "label": "Incidents", "intro": "Non-combat losses, medical evacuations, and other incidents." },
    { "type": "crash",     "label": "Crashes",   "intro": "Aircraft losses." },
    { "type": "operation", "label": "Operations","intro": "Named operations and major movements." },
    { "type": "morale",    "label": "Morale",    "intro": "Recreation, stand-down, and morale on the firebase." },
    { "type": "memorial",  "label": "Memorials", "intro": "Commemorations and remembrance." }
  ] %}
  {% set knownTypes = ["contact", "incident", "crash", "operation", "morale", "memorial"] %}
  {% set uhYears = [1965, 1966, 1967, 1968, 1969, 1970, 1971, 1972, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026] %}

  {# Determine the first non-empty type so it can be the default-open tab #}
  {% set firstHolder = [] %}
  {% for section in typeSections %}
    {% set te = [] %}
    {% for evt in publishedEvents %}{% if evt.data.type == section.type %}{% set te = (te.push(evt), te) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {% if te.length and firstHolder.length == 0 %}{% set firstHolder = (firstHolder.push(section.type), firstHolder) %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {# catch-all "other" becomes default only if no known-type events exist at all #}
  {% set otherEvents = [] %}
  {% for evt in publishedEvents %}{% if evt.data.type not in knownTypes %}{% set otherEvents = (otherEvents.push(evt), otherEvents) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  {% if firstHolder.length == 0 and otherEvents.length %}{% set firstHolder = (firstHolder.push("other"), firstHolder) %}{% endif %}
  {% set firstActive = firstHolder[0] if firstHolder.length else "" %}

  {# ── Event card macro ── #}
  {% macro eventCard(evt) %}
    {% set kia_count = evt.data.casualties.kia | length if evt.data.casualties and evt.data.casualties.kia else 0 %}
    {% set dow_count = evt.data.casualties.dow | length if evt.data.casualties and evt.data.casualties.dow else 0 %}
    {% set wia_count = evt.data.casualties.wia | length if evt.data.casualties and evt.data.casualties.wia else 0 %}
    {% set mia_count = evt.data.casualties.mia | length if evt.data.casualties and evt.data.casualties.mia else 0 %}
    {% set nc_count  = evt.data.casualties.non_combat | length if evt.data.casualties and evt.data.casualties.non_combat else 0 %}
    {% set total_cas = kia_count + dow_count + wia_count + mia_count + nc_count %}
    <a href="/events/{{ evt.data.slug }}/" class="uh-card-link">
      <div class="uh-card">
        <div class="uh-date-col"><div class="uh-date-day">{{ evt.data.date | locDate }}</div></div>
        <div class="uh-divider"></div>
        <div class="uh-body">
          <p class="uh-title">{{ evt.data.title }}{% if evt.data.slug == "deployment-vietnam-1965" %} <span class="uh-bookend">First in</span>{% elif evt.data.slug == "departure-vietnam-1972" %} <span class="uh-bookend">Last out</span>{% endif %}</p>
          {% if evt.data.location %}<p class="uh-location">{{ evt.data.location }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if total_cas > 0 %}
            <div class="uh-casualties">
              {% if kia_count > 0 %}<span class="evt-cas-pill evt-cas-kia">{{ kia_count }} KIA</span>{% endif %}
              {% if dow_count > 0 %}<span class="evt-cas-pill evt-cas-dow">{{ dow_count }} DOW</span>{% endif %}
              {% if wia_count > 0 %}<span class="evt-cas-pill evt-cas-wia">{{ wia_count }} WIA</span>{% endif %}
              {% if mia_count > 0 %}<span class="evt-cas-pill evt-cas-mia">{{ mia_count }} MIA</span>{% endif %}
              {% if nc_count  > 0 %}<span class="evt-cas-pill evt-cas-nc">{{ nc_count }} Non-combat</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endmacro %}

  {# ── TAB BAR ── #}
  <div class="tabs-bar">
    {% for section in typeSections %}
      {% set typeEvents = [] %}
      {% for evt in publishedEvents %}{% if evt.data.type == section.type %}{% set typeEvents = (typeEvents.push(evt), typeEvents) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% if typeEvents.length %}
        <div class="tab{% if section.type == firstActive %} active{% endif %}" data-tab="{{ section.type }}">{{ section.label }} <span class="uh-count">({{ typeEvents.length }})</span></div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% if otherEvents.length %}
      <div class="tab{% if firstActive == 'other' %} active{% endif %}" data-tab="other">Other <span class="uh-count">({{ otherEvents.length }})</span></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {# ── TAB PANELS (one per type, grouped by year) ── #}
  {% for section in typeSections %}
    {% set typeEvents = [] %}
    {% for evt in publishedEvents %}{% if evt.data.type == section.type %}{% set typeEvents = (typeEvents.push(evt), typeEvents) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {% if typeEvents.length %}
      <div class="tab-content" id="tab-{{ section.type }}"{% if section.type != firstActive %} style="display:none"{% endif %}>
        {% if section.intro %}<p class="uh-tabintro">{{ section.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% for y in uhYears %}
          {% set yearEvents = [] %}
          {% for evt in typeEvents %}{% if (evt.data.date | string | truncate(4, true, "")) == (y | string) %}{% set yearEvents = (yearEvents.push(evt), yearEvents) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
          {% if yearEvents.length %}
            <div class="uh-yr"><span class="uh-yr-label">{{ y }}</span><span class="uh-yr-count">{{ yearEvents.length }} record{% if yearEvents.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span><span class="uh-yr-line"></span></div>
            {% for evt in yearEvents %}{{ eventCard(evt) }}{% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  {# ── Catch-all: published events whose type is not one of the known sections ── #}
  {% if otherEvents.length %}
    <div class="tab-content" id="tab-other"{% if firstActive != 'other' %} style="display:none"{% endif %}>
      <p class="uh-tabintro">Records not yet categorized.</p>
      {% for y in uhYears %}
        {% set yearEvents = [] %}
        {% for evt in otherEvents %}{% if (evt.data.date | string | truncate(4, true, "")) == (y | string) %}{% set yearEvents = (yearEvents.push(evt), yearEvents) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        {% if yearEvents.length %}
          <div class="uh-yr"><span class="uh-yr-label">{{ y }}</span><span class="uh-yr-count">{{ yearEvents.length }} record{% if yearEvents.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span><span class="uh-yr-line"></span></div>
          {% for evt in yearEvents %}{{ eventCard(evt) }}{% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% endif %}

{% endif %}

</main>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}

<script src="/assets/js/main.js"></script>
<script>
function activateTab(name) {
  var matchingTab = document.querySelector('.tab[data-tab="' + name + '"]');
  if (!matchingTab) return;
  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(function(t) { t.classList.remove('active'); });
  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(function(c) { c.style.display = 'none'; });
  matchingTab.classList.add('active');
  var target = document.getElementById('tab-' + name);
  if (target) target.style.display = 'block';
}
document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(function(tab) {
  tab.addEventListener('click', function() {
    activateTab(tab.dataset.tab);
    history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + tab.dataset.tab);
  });
});
(function() {
  var hash = window.location.hash.replace('#', '');
  if (hash) activateTab(hash);
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
